# Long jump-over-blocker showcase.
# Goal: lower 32-degree jump() angle flies longer, clears a farther blocker, then reaches the 2.
table brunswick_gc4_9ft
ball cue at (1.30, 1.20)
ball one at (1.30, 2.05)
ball two at (1.30, 4.30)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
trace(max_events: 8)
shot(cue).heading(0deg).speed(185ips).tip(side: 0.0R, height: 0.0R).jump(32deg).using(default)
